5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's communication patterns. Let us remain calm and see who attempts to lead the group too aggressively.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. A cool-headed approach is best. I will be watching for any inconsistencies in how people present themselves.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Logic should be our primary tool. I'll be observing the flow of the conversation to see if anyone is trying to manipulate the narrative from the start.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I want to help. I'll just listen carefully and try to be honest with everyone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,A peaceful start is always preferable. I shall happily observe and listen to the thoughts of my companions.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, your honesty is appreciated, but remember that in this game, innocence can be a mask. We must all remain vigilant.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Toshio is right. While we should be kind, we cannot afford blind trust.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. I'm curious if anyone has a specific strategy for identifying the werewolf or the possessed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,A strategy? I don't really have one... I just hope we can all get along while we find the wolf!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe the truth often reveals itself in the silences between words. I will be paying attention to what is not being said.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, your focus on logic is sound. I will be looking for contradictions that emerge once the Seer's information becomes available tomorrow.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll be doing the same. The first day is always about establishing a baseline of behavior.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Once the Seer has their first divination, the dynamics will shift. I'll be watching who reacts most strongly to that news.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,I'll try my best to remember everything everyone says! That's my plan!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a diligent approach, Minato. Let us see what the first night brings us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have established our general approach. I shall retire for the night.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
